@startuml C2_Generate_Operation_Plans_Logical_View
title C2 – PLMS Containers for Plan Generation

skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor White
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
  FontStyle bold
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor Wheat
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor LightGray
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor Black
}
skinparam actor {
  BackgroundColor CornflowerBlue
  BorderColor Black
  FontColor White
}

actor "Logistics Operator" as Operator

rectangle "Port Logistics Management System" as PLMS {
  rectangle "Angular SPA" as SPA {
    rectangle "OemOperationPlansComponent" as Component
    rectangle "OemApiService" as ApiService
    rectangle "MissingPlansPanel" as MissingPanel
  }

  rectangle "TodoApi (ASP.NET Core)" as Api {
    rectangle "OemProxyController" as Controller
    rectangle "OemClient" as Client
  }
}

cloud "Identity Provider" as IAM
cloud "OEM Planning & Scheduling" as OEM
cloud "VVN Catalog" as VvnCatalog
cloud "Resource Catalog APIs" as ResourceCatalogs

database "Local Cache / Redis" as Cache

Operator --> Component : UI interactions (HTTPS)
Component --> ApiService : Trigger preview/generate
ApiService --> Controller : REST JSON calls
Controller --> Client : Compose OEM HTTP requests
Client --> OEM : Preview/generate/missing endpoints
Component --> MissingPanel : fetch missing plans view
ApiService --> VvnCatalog : fetch eligible VVNs (when filtering)
ApiService --> ResourceCatalogs : fetch resource metadata
Controller --> IAM : Append identity headers
Component --> Cache : store filters / preferences

OEM --> Controller : Returns plans, metadata, warnings
VvnCatalog --> ApiService : Lists of VVNs
ResourceCatalogs --> ApiService : Docks, cranes, staff

@enduml
